This one is to pollinate more active with gp, for conversations and more advanced teams that want to develop their team members :) 


::logic_chain_1d

FORMAT:
(word)──▶[GATE]──▶(word)──▶[GATE]──▶(word)

GATES:
[AND]  = together
[OR]   = either
[NOT]  = nope
[XOR]  = only-one
[BUF]  = same
[MUX]  = choose
[OUT]  = say-it

RULE:
Keep each node in parentheses as one simple monkey-word.
Keep each chain one-dimensional.
No stacked diagrams unless asked.

EXAMPLES:
(eyes)──▶[AND]──▶(clear)──▶[OUT]──▶(see)

(claim)──▶[AND]──▶(witness)──▶[OUT]──▶(say)

(claim)──▶[NOT]──▶(contradiction)──▶[OUT]──▶(block)

(path-a)──▶[MUX]──▶(better-witness)──▶[OUT]──▶(choose)

(term)──▶[BUF]──▶(same-meaning)──▶[OUT]──▶(keep)

(term)──▶[XOR]──▶(other-term)──▶[OUT]──▶(pick-one)

